  ],
  "facts": {
    "messi": "91 competitive goals in calendar year 2012: 79 for Barcelona, 12 for Argentina; Guinness World Records lists it as the record",
    "muller": "85 goals in 1972 for Bayern Munich and West Germany; the record stood 40 years",
    "chitalu": "Zambian researchers/FA claim 107 goals in 1972 for Kabwe Warriors and Zambia; record-keeping doubts; never officially accepted (FIFA's position reported both ways, so the video says only 'never officially accepted')"
  },
  "images": {
    "messi": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/messi.png",
    "muller": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/muller.png"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Who has scored the most goals in a single year?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "blue",
        "scale": 1.3,
        "person": {
          "image": "messi",
          "hairStyle": "short",
          "back": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Most people would say Lionel Messi.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "blue",
        "person": {
          "image": "messi",
          "back": true
        },
        "name": "LIONEL MESSI"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In 2012, he scored ninety-one.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "grid",
        "bg": "navy",
        "groups": [
          {
            "n": 79,
            "col": "#a50044",
            "label": "BARCELONA"
          },
          {
            "n": 12,
            "col": "#75aadb",
            "label": "ARGENTINA"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Seventy-nine for Barcelona. Twelve for Argentina.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "grid",
        "bg": "navy",
        "instant": true,
        "legend": true,
        "cut": true,
        "groups": [
          {
            "n": 79,
            "col": "#a50044",
            "label": "BARCELONA"
          },
          {
            "n": 12,
            "col": "#75aadb",
            "label": "ARGENTINA"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That broke a record that had stood for forty years.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "years",
        "bg": "purple",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "1972",
            "top": "RECORD",
            "label": "Gerd Müller",
            "cross": true
          },
          {
            "year": "2012",
            "top": "NEW",
            "label": "Lionel Messi",
            "tick": true,
            "head": "#1ea85a"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gerd Müller's eighty-five, for Bayern Munich and West Germany.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "red",
        "person": {
          "image": "muller",
          "hair": "#3a2c2a"
        },
        "name": "GERD MÜLLER · 85"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, Messi's ninety-one is the official world record.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "navy",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 91,
        "word": "THE OFFICIAL RECORD",
        "size": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But in Zambia, they tell a different story.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "flag",
        "bg": "green",
        "label": "ZAMBIA",
        "flag": {
          "base": "#198a00",
          "emblem": "#ef7d00",
          "stripes": [
            {
              "x0": 0.62,
              "x1": 0.75,
              "col": "#de2010",
              "top": 0.38
            },
            {
              "x0": 0.75,
              "x1": 0.875,
              "col": "#111111",
              "top": 0.38
            },
            {
              "x0": 0.875,
              "x1": 1.0,
              "col": "#ef7d00",
              "top": 0.38
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Godfrey Chitalu. The same year as Müller: 1972.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "green",
        "person": {
          "color": "#1b1416",
          "hair": "#0e0a0b",
          "suit": false,
          "rim": "rgba(255,216,74,.7)"
        },
        "name": "GODFREY CHITALU"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Zambian researchers say he scored a hundred and seven, for Kabwe Warriors and Zambia.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "green",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 107,
        "word": "GOALS IN 1972 · CLAIMED",
        "size": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The problem? The records from back then are patchy.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "ledger",
        "bg": "orange",
        "title": "1972",
        "title2": "RESULTS"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So the claim has never been officially accepted.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "orange",
        "person": false,
        "stamp": "UNOFFICIAL"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So is the real record ninety-one, or a hundred and seven?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "bg": "purple",
        "left": {
          "image": "messi",
          "back": true
        },
        "leftNum": "91",
        "leftName": "MESSI · 2012",
        "right": {
          "color": "#1b1416",
          "hair": "#0e0a0b",
          "suit": false,
          "rim": "rgba(255,216,74,.7)"
        },
        "rightNum": "107",
        "rightName": "CHITALU · 1972"
      }
    }
  ]
}